        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restaurant game about the beloved Vietnamese grilled pork with rice noodles dish, a popular dish in Hanoi, Vietnam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing the university entrance exam, Tom decided to take care of the family's grilled pork noodle business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his friends, let's help Tom become successful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cute graphics and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Relaxing game play but also challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fast actions to serve customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose and hire staff members with most suitable skills for: quality, speed and food cleanliness and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Easy to learn, easy to play and understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Perfect when you are on public transport or waiting for appointments or in queues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Buy upgrades from the store to increase your efficiency and profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 locations to open shop.</p>",
